{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Wisdom</b> — He indicates that just as I have rebuked you, so does wisdom warn the simpletons, and this is the way of mashal." "<b>Outside</b> — where the multitude of the people are." "<b>She cries out</b> — the meaning is that of calling, like ותעבור הרנה (and the shout passed along)." "<b>In the squares</b> — in the place of those passing to and fro."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:46.806849252Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}